    "created_at": "2016-04-26T07:26:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-26T07:26:04Z",
    "body": "And the current patch doesn't address the string-or-byte question, though I guess if nobody but Gecko does that we might want to leave that out. It's also a lot less useful now you can no longer use `javascript` URLs everywhere (e.g., it does not work in `<img>`).\n",
